@startuml
top to bottom direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam nodesep 25
skinparam ranksep 30
title Class diagram — SS2 Xe cá nhân, chỗ đỗ và check-in/out

class PersonalVehicle <<entity, proposed>> {
  +vehicle_id: str
  +owner_id: str
  +owner_name: str
  +plate_number: str
  +vehicle_type: str
  +brand: str
  +battery_kwh: float
  +ownership: Ownership = PERSONAL
  +registered_at: datetime
  +status: str = "REGISTERED"
  --
  +normalize_plate(raw_plate: str): str
  +is_owned_by(user_id: str): bool
}

class ParkingReservation <<entity, proposed>> {
  +reservation_id: str
  +owner_id: str
  +vehicle_id: str
  +plate_number: str
  +hub_id: str
  +request_charging: bool
  +current_soc: float
  +deposit_held_vnd: int = 50000
  +created_at: datetime
  +booking_start_time: datetime
  +expires_at: datetime
  +expired_at: datetime | None
  +status: ParkingReservationStatus
  --
  +is_expired(sim_now: datetime): bool
  +can_check_in(sim_now: datetime): bool
}

class ParkingSession <<entity, proposed>> {
  +session_id: str
  +reservation_id: str
  +vehicle_id: str
  +hub_id: str
  +check_in_time: datetime
  +check_out_time: datetime | None
  +charging_request_id: str | None
  +charging_session_id: str | None
  +parking_fee_vnd: int = 5000
  +invoice_id: str | None
  --
  +attach_charging_ref(request_id: str, session_id: str | None = None): None
  +build_parking_charge_line(): ChargeLine
}

class PersonalEVService <<proposed service>> {
  -billing_service: BillingService
  -charging_service: ChargingService
  --
  +register_personal_ev(owner_id: str, owner_name: str, plate_number: str, vehicle_type: str, brand: str, battery_kwh: float): OperationResult[PersonalVehicle]
  +reserve_personal_ev_slot(owner_id: str, vehicle_id: str, hub_id: str, booking_start_time: datetime, request_charging: bool = False, current_soc: float = 50.0, operation_key: str = ""): OperationResult[ParkingReservation]
  +check_in_personal_ev(owner_id: str, reservation_id: str, operation_key: str = ""): OperationResult[ParkingSession]
  +check_out_personal_ev(owner_id: str, reservation_id: str, operation_key: str = ""): OperationResult[SettlementResult]
  +sweep_expired_personal_reservations(sim_now: datetime): OperationResult[list[str]]
}

class "personal_ev.render" as SS2UI <<implemented UI>> {
  --
  +_init_pev_state(): None
  +render(): None
}

class "core.personal_ev" as PersonalEVModule <<implemented module>> {
  --
  +parse_time(t_str: str): datetime
  +format_time(dt: datetime): str
  +register_personal_ev(state: dict, owner_id: str, owner_name: str, plate_number: str, ev_type: str, brand: str, battery_kwh: float): tuple[bool, dict | None, str]
  +reserve_personal_ev_slot(state: dict, owner_id: str, ev_id: str, hub_id: str, request_charging: bool = False, current_soc: float = 50.0, booking_start_time: str | None = None): tuple[bool, dict | None, str]
  +sweep_expired_personal_reservations(state: dict): int
  +check_in_personal_ev(state: dict, reservation_id: str): tuple[bool, str]
  +check_out_personal_ev(state: dict, reservation_id: str, duration_hours: float = 2.0, kwh_charged: float = 3.5, overstay_minutes: int = 0): tuple[bool, dict | None, str]
}

class "User / Vehicle (TV1)" as SharedUserVehicle <<shared contract>> {
  +user_id: str
  +vehicle_id: str
  +ownership: Ownership
  +status: VehicleStatus
}

class "Hub (TV3)" as SharedHub <<shared contract>> {
  +hub_id: str
  +name: str
  +total_slots: int
  +available_slots: int
  +destination_holds: int
  +charging_ports: dict[str, int]
}

class "BillingService (TV1)" as BillingService <<shared contract>> {
  --
  +hold_deposit(owner_id: str, reference_id: str, amount_vnd: int, operation_key: str): OperationResult[DepositResult]
  +release_deposit(owner_id: str, reference_id: str, operation_key: str): OperationResult[DepositResult]
  +settle_no_show(owner_id: str, reference_id: str, operation_key: str): OperationResult[SettlementResult]
  +settle_invoice(owner_id: str, reference_id: str, charge_lines: list[ChargeLine], operation_key: str): OperationResult[SettlementResult]
}

class "ChargingService (TV5)" as ChargingService <<shared contract>> {
  --
  +request_charging(owner_id: str, vehicle_id: str, hub_id: str, current_soc: float, target_soc: float = 100.0, reservation_id: str | None = None): OperationResult[ChargingRequestResult]
  +get_bill(session_id: str): OperationResult[ChargingBill]
}

PersonalVehicle --|> SharedUserVehicle : kế thừa Vehicle\n(ownership=PERSONAL)
ParkingReservation "0..*" --> "1" PersonalVehicle : gắn với xe cá nhân
ParkingReservation "0..*" --> "1" SharedHub : giữ chỗ đích\n(destination_holds)
ParkingReservation "1" --> "0..1" ParkingSession : kích hoạt khi check-in
ParkingSession "0..*" --> "1" SharedHub : chiếm chỗ vật lý\n(current_vehicles)

PersonalEVService ..> PersonalVehicle : tạo/kiểm tra hồ sơ xe\n(UC_SS2_01)
PersonalEVService ..> ParkingReservation : đặt chỗ & quét hết hạn\n(UC_SS2_02)
PersonalEVService ..> ParkingSession : mở/đóng phiên đỗ\n(UC_SS2_03, UC_SS2_04)
PersonalEVService ..> PersonalEVModule : ánh xạ hàm hiện tại
PersonalEVService ..> BillingService : hợp đồng tài chính TV1
PersonalEVService ..> ChargingService : INT-01 request_charging()\nINT-02 get_bill()

SS2UI ..> PersonalEVModule : lời gọi hàm hiện tại
SS2UI ..> PersonalEVService : thiết kế mục tiêu\n(UC_SS2_01..04)

note right of PersonalEVModule
  Dữ liệu hiện lưu dạng dict trong session_state;
  adapter ánh xạ ev_id -> vehicle_id.
  Hạn đến: expires_at = booking_start_time + 30 phút.
  Phí đỗ giữ 5.000 VNĐ/lượt (chênh lệch với SRS
  yêu cầu tính theo giờ).
end note

note bottom of ChargingService
  Giao tiếp mục tiêu thuộc TV5:
  - INT-01 request_charging() khi check-in hợp lệ.
  - INT-02 get_bill() khi check-out (SS2 chỉ đọc,
    không tự tính lại giá điện/phí quá giờ).
  Prototype hiện tại chưa tạo ChargingSession bên SS5
  khi xe cá nhân check-in.
end note

note bottom of BillingService
  Hợp đồng tài chính thuộc TV1:
  - Cọc 50.000 VNĐ; no-show phạt 10.000, hoàn 40.000 VNĐ.
  - settle_invoice() đối trừ cọc, thu phí đỗ + phí sạc,
    ghi nợ nếu thiếu số dư, chống thu trùng theo
    operation_key và charge_id.
end note
@enduml
